OL,3,AMajor tech stocks plunge as US midterms
OL,4,Aadd to fears of AI slowdown
OL,5,
OL,6,FHundreds of billions of dollars in
OL,7,Fmarket value has been wiped from major
OL,8,Ftech firms in the US and Asia in a
OL,9,Fstock market rout after the US midterm
OL,10,Felections sparked concerns of a
OL,11,Fslowdown in artificial intelligence
OL,12,Fdevelopment.
OL,14,FShares in firms across the tech and AI
OL,15,Fsectors plummeted following Democratic
OL,16,Fwins after election campaigns run on
OL,17,Fslowing AI.
OL,23,APub: 05-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG3/19
OL,24,ANext PageBTechnologyC Nat RadioFCulture
